# Sprint Plan (Detailed)

## Sprint 1 – Copilot Bootstrap
- Deliverables:
  - /crm/ai page (embed/proxy Farfalle)
  - Farfalle service account auth to CRM
  - Tool: list_docs (Leads)
- Acceptance:
  - Demo: “Show top 10 Open leads” via chat; returns records with links

## Sprint 2 – CRUD + Email
- Deliverables:
  - Tools: get_doc, insert_doc, set_value
  - Tools: email_draft, email_send; Human Inbox surfaced
- Acceptance:
  - Demo: “Create a lead and draft an intro email; then send it”

## Sprint 3 – Import & Mapping
- Deliverables:
  - Tools: import_rows (sync), job_status, autogenerate_mapping
  - Dedupe path and dry-run flag
- Acceptance:
  - Demo: “Import this CSV (paste) and report successes/failures”

## Sprint 4 – Deals/Tasks/Calls
- Deliverables:
  - CRUD tools leveraged for deals, tasks, call logs
  - Summarization prompts (LLM) over lists
- Acceptance:
  - Demo: “Summarize pipeline by stage; create tasks for stalled deals”

## Sprint 5 – Triage & Insights
- Deliverables:
  - Implement `email.triage` in agent router using LLM
  - Communications retrieval helper in tools
- Acceptance:
  - Demo: “Triage thread X and propose next steps; open draft”

## Sprint 6 – Security/Observability
- Deliverables:
  - Role-aware tool constraints, audit logs, structured metrics
  - Load tests; cost/latency dashboards
- Acceptance:
  - Demo: restricted user can’t update deals; audit trail visible